1
00:00:57,224 --> 00:01:02,313
A YEAR AND SIX MONTHS AGO

2
00:01:11,614 --> 00:01:12,531
Have a seat.

3
00:01:26,128 --> 00:01:30,257
After your father's business fell,
he went abroad to avoid the debtors.

4
00:01:30,341 --> 00:01:32,885
Your mother underwent
several major surgeries.

5
00:01:33,636 --> 00:01:36,055
And you're still paying off the bills.

6
00:01:37,848 --> 00:01:40,559
-Ma'am.
-You accepted Yi-jun's offer

7
00:01:40,643 --> 00:01:43,437
not because of status,
but because of money.

8
00:01:47,733 --> 00:01:49,693
The retained earnings you're looking for…

9
00:01:51,403 --> 00:01:52,655
I have it.

10
00:01:55,699 --> 00:01:57,368
You have two options.

11
00:01:57,785 --> 00:02:02,414
Option one. We form a strategic alliance.

12
00:02:03,123 --> 00:02:03,958
Option two.

13
00:02:05,125 --> 00:02:06,710
You decline my offer.

14
00:02:09,922 --> 00:02:11,090
Here's ten billion won.

15
00:02:11,924 --> 00:02:15,761
I'll make you the CFO of Taekang Trading's
North American operations.

16
00:02:17,638 --> 00:02:18,931
This is the signing bonus.

17
00:02:24,270 --> 00:02:26,856
What if I choose the second option?

18
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:30,401
No one who learns my secrets

19
00:02:31,610 --> 00:02:32,653
has survived.

20
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,742
And you just found out

21
00:02:39,535 --> 00:02:41,912
where the retained earnings went.

22
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,503
I'll buy

23
00:02:51,005 --> 00:02:52,214
your sense of shame.

24
00:02:53,799 --> 00:02:57,845
Managing Director Yoon Yi-jun's
successful handling of foreign affairs

25
00:02:57,928 --> 00:03:01,015
drove up Taekang's stock price.

26
00:03:01,098 --> 00:03:03,017
Major securities firms predict that--

27
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,103
Who did you say found out?

28
00:03:07,229 --> 00:03:08,314
The secretary's name?

29
00:03:08,898 --> 00:03:11,942
Han Eun-young of the TF Team.

30
00:03:16,697 --> 00:03:17,948
Manager Park.

31
00:03:19,033 --> 00:03:20,951
A secretary's mouth is easy to shut.

32
00:03:22,202 --> 00:03:23,037
Uncle.

33
00:03:24,747 --> 00:03:25,831
You know

34
00:03:28,459 --> 00:03:30,002
I don't like noise.

35
00:03:31,545 --> 00:03:32,630
Do it quietly.

36
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:46,226
I think I'll use
the man I planted as a janitor.

37
00:04:15,923 --> 00:04:17,508
It's always noise and no results.

38
00:04:18,050 --> 00:04:20,719
Dropping the chandelier,
poisoning the milk,

39
00:04:21,428 --> 00:04:22,638
and causing a car accident.

40
00:04:22,721 --> 00:04:24,348
But we managed to get the pen.

41
00:04:24,431 --> 00:04:26,308
If this had gotten to the chairman--

42
00:04:26,392 --> 00:04:29,353
I would've done it already
if I were to wipe them out.

43
00:04:30,354 --> 00:04:33,232
From my father to Yi-jun. All at once.

44
00:04:35,401 --> 00:04:39,029
You are well aware of
why I avoid having things be noisy.

45
00:04:40,322 --> 00:04:41,573
This is my company.

46
00:04:43,242 --> 00:04:45,494
I won't tolerate Taekang being stained

47
00:04:46,704 --> 00:04:48,163
by family conflict.

48
00:04:50,833 --> 00:04:53,585
I understand. This will be the last time.

49
00:04:54,003 --> 00:04:55,337
No more noise.

50
00:04:57,464 --> 00:04:58,465
There better not be.

51
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:14,523
I broke up with her.

52
00:05:17,943 --> 00:05:19,153
I won't see her anymore.

53
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,079
Withdraw my request.

54
00:05:29,663 --> 00:05:31,832
The police have their own rules.

55
00:05:32,374 --> 00:05:36,295
It'd look bad on Taekang
if we meddle with them.

56
00:05:41,175 --> 00:05:43,844
I'll tell Mi-jin to clear out.

57
00:05:45,179 --> 00:05:46,096
Get ready.

58
00:05:47,056 --> 00:05:47,931
Yes, sir.

59
00:06:16,376 --> 00:06:17,419
Let's end it here.

60
00:06:19,254 --> 00:06:20,506
We'll get used to it.

61
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,092
It'll get easier.

62
00:06:27,930 --> 00:06:30,140
So go back to where you should be.

63
00:06:31,141 --> 00:06:32,684
I'll find my own place too.

64
00:06:40,526 --> 00:06:41,527
Jae-hee.

65
00:06:44,238 --> 00:06:45,239
Take care.

66
00:06:57,459 --> 00:06:59,503
EPISODE 11

67
00:07:12,182 --> 00:07:13,225
Yi-jun.

68
00:07:16,061 --> 00:07:18,647
Let's talk for a second. Please.

69
00:07:25,529 --> 00:07:28,031
How many times do I have to tell you?
It's over.

70
00:07:29,783 --> 00:07:31,785
It's the first time I've loved someone.

71
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,872
I don't know how to break up.

72
00:07:37,457 --> 00:07:39,168
This won't change anything.

73
00:07:40,210 --> 00:07:42,838
I won't see you again.

74
00:07:47,050 --> 00:07:48,385
You do that, then.

75
00:07:50,429 --> 00:07:51,889
I'll come to see you again,

76
00:07:52,681 --> 00:07:53,974
wait for you,

77
00:07:55,392 --> 00:07:56,977
and keep liking you.

78
00:08:18,415 --> 00:08:20,918
Hey, Jae-hee.

79
00:08:24,379 --> 00:08:27,925
Oh my, why are you crying?

80
00:08:29,009 --> 00:08:30,219
What's wrong?

81
00:08:31,178 --> 00:08:34,556
-Mom.
-What is it? What happened?

82
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:37,476
I don't know what to do anymore.

83
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:39,561
What's wrong?

84
00:08:40,687 --> 00:08:42,814
-Mom.
-It's okay.

85
00:08:43,565 --> 00:08:45,275
What is it?

86
00:08:45,359 --> 00:08:49,321
KUNMANDU

87
00:08:49,404 --> 00:08:50,572
Mom.

88
00:08:55,577 --> 00:08:56,536
Thank you.

89
00:08:59,665 --> 00:09:03,168
Jae-hee, I'm grateful
that we only got suspended.

90
00:09:04,795 --> 00:09:06,672
Why are you still crying?

91
00:09:09,383 --> 00:09:11,885
Yesterday, you cried
while you were eating bibimbap,

92
00:09:11,969 --> 00:09:13,470
saying you tasted food for him.

93
00:09:13,553 --> 00:09:16,848
The other day, when I bought you steak
with the money I saved up,

94
00:09:16,932 --> 00:09:18,976
you cried, saying his steak was better.

95
00:09:19,059 --> 00:09:20,852
Why are you crying over jjajangmyeon now?

96
00:09:22,229 --> 00:09:23,397
Buy me a meal.

97
00:09:34,866 --> 00:09:37,869
They must've had jjajangmyeon together.
Goodness gracious.

98
00:09:37,953 --> 00:09:40,289
I'm saying this for your sake, okay?

99
00:09:40,372 --> 00:09:41,957
Stop going to his place.

100
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:43,959
You'll only be humiliated!

101
00:09:44,293 --> 00:09:46,586
Learn from Seok-jin!
He didn't keep going to see you!

102
00:09:47,379 --> 00:09:48,547
You little…

103
00:09:49,715 --> 00:09:53,385
So stop going to his house
and don't call him.

104
00:09:53,468 --> 00:09:54,636
Let go.

105
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,555
Don't even text him or wait for him.

106
00:10:07,941 --> 00:10:08,942
Take care.

107
00:10:09,860 --> 00:10:10,986
Don't do this.

108
00:10:11,069 --> 00:10:12,279
You don't mean it.

109
00:10:12,904 --> 00:10:15,157
Don't go, Yi-jun!

110
00:10:19,745 --> 00:10:20,996
Don't go, Jae-hee!

111
00:10:31,590 --> 00:10:32,966
I'LL COME SEE YOU AGAIN…

112
00:10:33,050 --> 00:10:36,136
I'll come see you again, wait for you,

113
00:10:36,928 --> 00:10:38,180
and keep liking you.

114
00:11:38,365 --> 00:11:40,283
But I also like her.

115
00:11:41,701 --> 00:11:42,536
Ara.

116
00:11:44,079 --> 00:11:45,330
That one.

117
00:11:45,414 --> 00:11:46,957
Is that your favorite?

118
00:11:47,499 --> 00:11:49,251
You protected me.

119
00:11:51,878 --> 00:11:55,298
So I wouldn't find anything out
and put myself in danger.

120
00:12:06,726 --> 00:12:07,853
I miss her.

121
00:12:20,907 --> 00:12:23,034
-Are you just coming in?
-Yes.

122
00:12:24,119 --> 00:12:25,328
You must've been shocked.

123
00:12:26,455 --> 00:12:30,125
You unfortunately were the first person
to find Uncle like that.

124
00:12:32,294 --> 00:12:33,378
I know.

125
00:12:34,463 --> 00:12:35,464
Were you scared?

126
00:12:36,047 --> 00:12:39,843
It mimicked the exact image of Mom
burned into my memory.

127
00:12:43,722 --> 00:12:46,475
Was it done to see
if I would tremble like I did back then?

128
00:12:46,558 --> 00:12:48,310
Don't say things like that.

129
00:12:49,186 --> 00:12:50,729
Are you having nightmares again?

130
00:12:52,314 --> 00:12:53,732
It's Detective Kang, right?

131
00:12:54,524 --> 00:12:57,194
If you like her, go out with her.
I'll tell Father--

132
00:12:57,277 --> 00:13:00,322
I'm taking over your spot.

133
00:13:01,364 --> 00:13:03,950
I couldn't sleep because
I had so much to prepare for it,

134
00:13:05,076 --> 00:13:06,453
not because of anything else.

135
00:13:09,748 --> 00:13:12,209
I thought you weren't interested.

136
00:13:12,792 --> 00:13:14,294
It's just how things turned out.

137
00:13:15,462 --> 00:13:17,881
If it had been Na-jung,
I would've felt less guilty.

138
00:13:19,174 --> 00:13:20,926
You feel guilty toward me?

139
00:13:21,009 --> 00:13:22,385
Yes, I do.

140
00:13:23,845 --> 00:13:24,804
To me,

141
00:13:27,265 --> 00:13:28,808
you were like a mother.

142
00:13:30,143 --> 00:13:32,020
The only one I could rely on.

143
00:13:42,447 --> 00:13:46,076
Thanks to you, we avoided being dismissed.

144
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:47,327
It was nothing.

145
00:13:49,663 --> 00:13:53,458
Your investigation team has gathered
a lot of information on Taekang, right?

146
00:13:53,917 --> 00:13:54,834
So,

147
00:13:55,835 --> 00:13:58,755
I'd like to request your cooperation
with a special investigation.

148
00:14:00,632 --> 00:14:03,301
As you know, I'm suspended from duty.

149
00:14:03,385 --> 00:14:06,179
I can't even go to work or roam around.

150
00:14:06,263 --> 00:14:08,431
I'm worried I might get caught.

151
00:14:14,646 --> 00:14:17,399
Well, we do specialize
in off-the-record investigations.

152
00:14:18,483 --> 00:14:19,317
One more thing.

153
00:14:20,735 --> 00:14:23,947
Detective Kang Jae-hee
takes no part in this.

154
00:14:38,003 --> 00:14:39,629
You said to come if I can handle it.

155
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,716
I'm a lawyer handling you, my client.

156
00:14:43,425 --> 00:14:44,509
I'll take it.

157
00:14:47,137 --> 00:14:48,054
What?

158
00:14:56,813 --> 00:14:58,523
GROOM KIM GYU-MIN
BRIDE LEE HYE-JUNG

159
00:15:00,734 --> 00:15:03,445
He had another woman
he'd been seeing for the same three years.

160
00:15:04,904 --> 00:15:08,033
Or had she been with him
for longer than that?

161
00:15:09,451 --> 00:15:11,036
He was never that kind of guy.

162
00:15:11,119 --> 00:15:16,541
It's a cliché story that shows
that you should never say never.

163
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:20,128
You're a fool.

164
00:15:22,005 --> 00:15:25,967
Is that how I became someone
who kept secrets?

165
00:15:27,052 --> 00:15:28,553
I'll keep doubting you.

166
00:15:29,929 --> 00:15:31,931
I'll keep wondering
what else you're hiding

167
00:15:32,557 --> 00:15:34,142
and whether you'll betray me.

168
00:15:34,768 --> 00:15:37,812
I'll distrust you
and obsess over every little thing.

169
00:15:39,397 --> 00:15:42,609
Even if you don't get tired of me
at first, you will eventually.

170
00:15:45,904 --> 00:15:47,947
I can't say I won't.

171
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,868
For the past few days,

172
00:15:52,827 --> 00:15:56,039
I've gone back and forth
several times a day.

173
00:15:56,122 --> 00:15:58,625
I'd decide to tell you,
and then change my mind.

174
00:15:59,668 --> 00:16:02,796
Eventually, I decided to keep it to myself

175
00:16:03,213 --> 00:16:05,048
and went to throw it away, but you got me.

176
00:16:05,131 --> 00:16:07,008
Then you should've just thrown it away.

177
00:16:08,093 --> 00:16:09,344
The scars on your heart

178
00:16:10,970 --> 00:16:13,098
don't go away, no matter how hard you try.

179
00:16:16,184 --> 00:16:19,396
You already see our end, don't you?

180
00:16:29,572 --> 00:16:31,866
You said to come if I could handle it.

181
00:16:33,743 --> 00:16:34,869
KIM GYU-MIN, LEE HYE-JUNG

182
00:16:36,037 --> 00:16:36,996
But…

183
00:16:39,916 --> 00:16:42,544
you had already made up your mind
before calling me here.

184
00:17:00,270 --> 00:17:02,856
I'm sorry for being a nuisance these days.

185
00:17:04,941 --> 00:17:08,486
I'm trying hard to control my emotions,

186
00:17:09,237 --> 00:17:10,363
but it's not working.

187
00:17:14,826 --> 00:17:17,537
Yi-jun pulled himself together
to find his way.

188
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:20,206
How long will you keep this up?

189
00:17:20,707 --> 00:17:22,959
You two met as a cop and a suspect.

190
00:17:23,042 --> 00:17:25,044
How long will you do this?
This isn't like you.

191
00:17:25,128 --> 00:17:27,255
This isn't like you, either.

192
00:17:28,923 --> 00:17:31,009
And Seok-jin is right this time.

193
00:17:31,092 --> 00:17:33,595
Yi-jun will be taking over the company.

194
00:17:33,678 --> 00:17:36,973
He wants to take out all the bad guys
before he takes over.

195
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:39,809
That's why he asked us to cooperate
with his investigation.

196
00:17:43,396 --> 00:17:44,439
What?

197
00:17:45,148 --> 00:17:47,525
I can't believe
I'm working with these fools.

198
00:17:47,609 --> 00:17:50,069
Did you just say "investigation"?

199
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:56,618
I guess Yi-jun had no choice.

200
00:17:56,701 --> 00:17:58,995
The culprit took off and Na Man-seok died.

201
00:17:59,078 --> 00:18:00,997
And he can't trust other cops.

202
00:18:03,416 --> 00:18:04,751
He has a suspect in mind,

203
00:18:05,585 --> 00:18:06,878
but he wouldn't tell me.

204
00:18:06,961 --> 00:18:09,506
The fact that there is a suspect means

205
00:18:09,589 --> 00:18:11,758
that he is exposed to danger.

206
00:18:12,175 --> 00:18:13,760
You shouldn't leave him alone!

207
00:18:22,644 --> 00:18:23,603
Jae-hee.

208
00:18:28,650 --> 00:18:29,734
Hello, sir.

209
00:18:29,818 --> 00:18:32,445
I'm Detective Kang,
assigned to provide close protection

210
00:18:32,529 --> 00:18:33,446
starting today.

211
00:18:34,447 --> 00:18:36,115
Why are you here?

212
00:18:36,199 --> 00:18:37,367
To protect you.

213
00:18:39,494 --> 00:18:41,830
I never requested this. Go back.

214
00:19:05,353 --> 00:19:07,564
I'll tell the investigation team,
so go back.

215
00:19:08,147 --> 00:19:10,567
I refuse your protection.

216
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:12,527
Unfortunately, that's not possible.

217
00:19:14,279 --> 00:19:15,822
You asked for cooperation first.

218
00:19:17,198 --> 00:19:19,158
I didn't ask you for cooperation.

219
00:19:19,242 --> 00:19:21,536
You don't get to choose

220
00:19:21,619 --> 00:19:24,038
which officer is assigned to you.

221
00:19:24,455 --> 00:19:25,999
Stop joking around.

222
00:19:26,082 --> 00:19:28,793
You're the one who needs
to keep personal feelings out of this.

223
00:19:28,877 --> 00:19:29,961
We broke up, remember?

224
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:32,422
You said nothing changes
even if I do this.

225
00:19:36,801 --> 00:19:39,888
Don't tell me
you still have feelings for me?

226
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,976
Hello, Mr. Yoon.

227
00:19:46,269 --> 00:19:47,228
Please come in.

228
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:57,906
Of course, she still has feelings.

229
00:19:57,989 --> 00:19:59,616
But what choice do we have?

230
00:19:59,699 --> 00:20:03,036
Units dealing with intellectual crimes
have applicants lined up out the door.

231
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:04,287
Everyone fights to get in.

232
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:06,039
But as for our team? Take a look.

233
00:20:06,122 --> 00:20:07,874
See? We only have guys like him.

234
00:20:07,957 --> 00:20:09,542
Look at that pathetic man.

235
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:13,546
What could Yi-jun do
when you say you don't have men?

236
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:16,799
Tell me about it. It may be unofficial,
but it's still an investigation.

237
00:20:16,883 --> 00:20:18,092
If Mr. Yoon is in danger,

238
00:20:18,176 --> 00:20:19,594
we'll get into bigger trouble.

239
00:20:19,677 --> 00:20:21,387
This is business at the end of the day.

240
00:20:21,471 --> 00:20:24,891
Jae-hee said she'd focus strictly
on the investigation.

241
00:20:24,974 --> 00:20:27,393
Mr. Yoon is also a heartless man.

242
00:20:27,477 --> 00:20:29,354
He'll keep things professional.

243
00:20:29,437 --> 00:20:31,356
-Right?
-It's better than watching him

244
00:20:31,439 --> 00:20:33,358
lose sleep over lovesickness.

245
00:20:33,441 --> 00:20:36,110
It's better than watching her waste away
and cause trouble.

246
00:20:36,194 --> 00:20:38,571
-Why do you keep taking pictures?
-It's for me.

247
00:20:38,655 --> 00:20:39,781
Look at the camera.

248
00:20:43,201 --> 00:20:44,535
Did you take my words lightly?

249
00:20:44,619 --> 00:20:46,204
It was hard for me to say them.

250
00:20:46,287 --> 00:20:49,415
There are certain qualities
a spy-movie heroine needs.

251
00:20:49,999 --> 00:20:51,793
Why do you keep sending me photos?

252
00:20:51,876 --> 00:20:53,920
I'm not interested in what you're doing.

253
00:20:54,003 --> 00:20:55,964
One, irresistible charm.

254
00:20:56,047 --> 00:20:57,507
Two, a poker face.

255
00:20:57,590 --> 00:20:59,050
Three, unwavering conviction.

256
00:20:59,133 --> 00:21:00,885
Attorney Kim Si-hyun.

257
00:21:00,969 --> 00:21:02,637
I clearly said we should stop--

258
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:07,976
And, amazingly,
you have all three qualities.

259
00:21:08,476 --> 00:21:10,061
That's why I came to ask a favor.

260
00:21:11,688 --> 00:21:13,481
Something only you can do.

261
00:21:25,410 --> 00:21:28,663
Leave Taekang Retail
and take over the foundation.

262
00:21:29,288 --> 00:21:30,623
Someone needs to run it.

263
00:21:33,376 --> 00:21:35,461
-The foundation?
-Your public image

264
00:21:35,545 --> 00:21:37,463
isn't too bad.

265
00:21:39,132 --> 00:21:40,508
I hear you like paintings.

266
00:21:43,845 --> 00:21:44,887
Father.

267
00:21:45,596 --> 00:21:48,474
I prefer hunting over paintings.

268
00:21:51,686 --> 00:21:52,895
Like you, Father.

269
00:21:53,730 --> 00:21:55,023
I wanted to be like you.

270
00:21:55,773 --> 00:21:56,983
I wanted to be you.

271
00:21:57,984 --> 00:21:59,277
I wanted your recognition.

272
00:22:01,237 --> 00:22:04,824
Why does it have to be Yi-jun?

273
00:22:06,743 --> 00:22:07,702
This is exactly why.

274
00:22:08,870 --> 00:22:11,581
He's the only one
who doesn't see me as his father.

275
00:22:12,248 --> 00:22:13,833
He'd bring a deal instead of this.

276
00:22:14,751 --> 00:22:17,336
That's the difference.
It's not about you being a girl.

277
00:22:20,465 --> 00:22:23,342
Then maybe I'll start doing the same.

278
00:22:23,426 --> 00:22:25,636
Fine. Let's see what you bring.

279
00:22:37,523 --> 00:22:38,983
That's why I came to ask a favor.

280
00:22:39,484 --> 00:22:40,943
Something only you can do.

281
00:22:45,615 --> 00:22:46,532
Hey, Secretary Lee.

282
00:22:48,493 --> 00:22:49,410
Yes, ma'am.

283
00:22:49,952 --> 00:22:51,370
I heard Mi-jin dropped by.

284
00:22:51,454 --> 00:22:53,831
Ms. Yoon Mi-jin just left.

285
00:22:54,749 --> 00:22:56,292
Do you have a message for her?

286
00:22:56,793 --> 00:22:58,544
Why are you playing coy?

287
00:23:00,004 --> 00:23:00,922
Hey.

288
00:23:02,048 --> 00:23:03,674
You'd better treat me well.

289
00:23:04,842 --> 00:23:07,428
You know the chief secretary position
is vacant, right?

290
00:23:10,306 --> 00:23:11,265
Did you just smile?

291
00:23:13,351 --> 00:23:15,436
-Are you curious?
-Yes.

292
00:23:16,938 --> 00:23:20,024
She's been visiting him a lot
ahead of the Retail shareholder meeting.

293
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:23,486
-Taekang Cultural Foundation.
-What about it?

294
00:23:23,569 --> 00:23:26,405
That's where the chief secretary
served as a chairman.

295
00:23:26,989 --> 00:23:28,282
And it's vacant.

296
00:23:30,159 --> 00:23:31,160
No way.

297
00:23:32,578 --> 00:23:34,622
Father wants her to go to the foundation?

298
00:23:42,463 --> 00:23:45,299
Don't touch anything else.
Just check the access records.

299
00:23:52,765 --> 00:23:54,225
Can you check the access records?

300
00:24:20,585 --> 00:24:21,544
Are you okay?

301
00:24:24,422 --> 00:24:27,508
Detective Kang's emotionally drained,
and you're sick with worry.

302
00:24:29,093 --> 00:24:30,720
Just spill it all and be together.

303
00:24:31,804 --> 00:24:32,889
When I fall into danger,

304
00:24:34,724 --> 00:24:39,103
she'll come running without hesitation
to save me like last time.

305
00:24:40,104 --> 00:24:41,439
My existence

306
00:24:43,191 --> 00:24:44,734
is a danger to her.

307
00:24:48,613 --> 00:24:49,614
Stay out here.

308
00:24:50,907 --> 00:24:51,782
Don't come in.

309
00:25:03,753 --> 00:25:05,129
When are you going to tell them

310
00:25:07,965 --> 00:25:09,300
what you found that day?

311
00:25:46,545 --> 00:25:49,340
The door lock access records show
the front door was opened

312
00:25:49,423 --> 00:25:51,342
six times around the time of the incident.

313
00:25:52,009 --> 00:25:55,554
So the chief secretary went in,
and Park Min-hwan came out.

314
00:25:55,638 --> 00:25:57,390
Then Yi-jun,

315
00:25:57,473 --> 00:25:59,809
followed by the detectives.
That's only four times.

316
00:25:59,892 --> 00:26:03,062
That means there were other visitors.

317
00:26:04,355 --> 00:26:07,775
If he hung himself, lividity would form
in the lower half of his body, right?

318
00:26:07,858 --> 00:26:11,028
Yes, but in Na Man-seok's case,
it was found on his back.

319
00:26:11,404 --> 00:26:13,114
His body was moved after death.

320
00:26:13,197 --> 00:26:14,782
He was most likely murdered.

321
00:26:18,661 --> 00:26:19,495
I'm sorry.

322
00:26:21,497 --> 00:26:23,207
To identify the visitor

323
00:26:23,291 --> 00:26:26,502
and determine
Na Man-seok's exact cause of death,

324
00:26:26,585 --> 00:26:30,256
our only option right now
is to find Park Min-hwan.

325
00:26:35,594 --> 00:26:37,013
When are you going to tell them

326
00:26:38,431 --> 00:26:39,598
what you found that day?

327
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:45,479
What could I have possibly seen
in that chaos?

328
00:26:46,314 --> 00:26:47,732
Why wouldn't you have seen it?

329
00:26:48,649 --> 00:26:50,484
I had my eyes on you the whole time.

330
00:26:51,569 --> 00:26:53,779
I was worried you'd cause trouble.

331
00:26:57,616 --> 00:26:58,909
It was a button, wasn't it?

332
00:27:08,002 --> 00:27:11,088
You have a suspect in mind,
and you want to investigate.

333
00:27:11,672 --> 00:27:12,923
Alone, at that.

334
00:27:16,093 --> 00:27:17,386
We broke up.

335
00:27:18,137 --> 00:27:21,223
Don't concern yourself
with what I do anymore.

336
00:27:21,307 --> 00:27:23,184
I can't agree to something impossible.

337
00:27:23,267 --> 00:27:25,353
But do whatever you want.

338
00:27:26,145 --> 00:27:27,605
Dig into it if you want.

339
00:27:27,688 --> 00:27:29,357
Just don't give up.

340
00:27:30,900 --> 00:27:34,195
I'll watch your back
so you won't get a single scratch.

341
00:27:50,002 --> 00:27:51,087
On the scene that day,

342
00:27:52,713 --> 00:27:53,964
I found something.

343
00:28:06,185 --> 00:28:07,186
And this

344
00:28:09,563 --> 00:28:10,689
is your control sample.

345
00:28:11,273 --> 00:28:13,234
It's to save your time, Detectives.

346
00:28:13,317 --> 00:28:16,529
So you have a suspect in mind.

347
00:28:20,574 --> 00:28:23,077
Is someone else coming?

348
00:28:23,577 --> 00:28:26,705
I prepared something
in case you're all hungry.

349
00:28:26,789 --> 00:28:29,667
-Then I'll go out and check.
-Okay.

350
00:28:31,085 --> 00:28:32,503
-I'll go with her.
-Sure.

351
00:28:32,878 --> 00:28:34,964
Only one person needs to go.

352
00:28:35,256 --> 00:28:37,508
This is great. I was getting hungry.

353
00:28:37,591 --> 00:28:38,551
Great timing.

354
00:28:42,054 --> 00:28:44,432
Isn't it heavy? I can take one.

355
00:28:44,515 --> 00:28:46,142
It's fine. I got it.

356
00:28:48,436 --> 00:28:51,981
I've been on my worst behavior recently.

357
00:28:53,065 --> 00:28:54,066
Sorry.

358
00:28:55,234 --> 00:28:56,986
If you know, pull yourself together.

359
00:28:57,903 --> 00:28:59,572
Okay, I will.

360
00:29:02,366 --> 00:29:05,828
I thought things would get awkward
with you after that day.

361
00:29:07,163 --> 00:29:08,122
I'm glad they didn't.

362
00:29:10,708 --> 00:29:11,876
I still feel awkward.

363
00:29:14,545 --> 00:29:15,463
But…

364
00:29:18,090 --> 00:29:20,134
What can I do? You like Yi-jun more.

365
00:29:21,844 --> 00:29:23,137
I won't go easy on you.

366
00:29:23,220 --> 00:29:25,347
Brace yourself.
I'm going to nag you like crazy.

367
00:29:30,478 --> 00:29:31,645
It doesn't bother me.

368
00:29:35,107 --> 00:29:38,611
I was getting a bit chilly.
How considerate of you.

369
00:29:39,904 --> 00:29:41,572
Gosh, Wan-gu.

370
00:29:42,198 --> 00:29:43,449
I must've given you my cold.

371
00:29:43,532 --> 00:29:45,618
-Here you go.
-Thanks.

372
00:29:45,701 --> 00:29:46,702
No problem.

373
00:29:47,119 --> 00:29:49,538
You must have a lot of body heat,
Detective Kang.

374
00:29:49,622 --> 00:29:51,207
She does more than I do.

375
00:29:51,290 --> 00:29:52,750
I guess she won't need a blanket.

376
00:29:54,210 --> 00:29:57,004
Someone will use it if I leave it here.

377
00:29:58,881 --> 00:30:01,300
Why aren't you eating with us?

378
00:30:01,800 --> 00:30:04,470
Don't mind him.
He's not interested in food right now.

379
00:30:06,096 --> 00:30:09,391
We are one short.
Have this. I don't need to eat.

380
00:30:09,892 --> 00:30:11,560
It's fine. I'll make do.

381
00:30:11,977 --> 00:30:12,811
Just eat it.

382
00:30:14,313 --> 00:30:16,815
Here. You like chicken.

383
00:30:18,192 --> 00:30:19,652
What about you?

384
00:30:19,735 --> 00:30:20,819
I don't need to eat.

385
00:30:22,279 --> 00:30:24,073
-But…
-Have this

386
00:30:24,865 --> 00:30:25,950
instead of that.

387
00:30:29,328 --> 00:30:31,038
-What?
-Eat up.

388
00:30:35,584 --> 00:30:36,502
I mean…

389
00:30:45,135 --> 00:30:47,471
You've been getting tons of texts
for days.

390
00:30:48,556 --> 00:30:49,807
Right.

391
00:30:50,307 --> 00:30:51,976
Season Two of Ms. L and Mr. K?

392
00:30:53,602 --> 00:30:54,645
LEGAL TEAM KIM SI-HYUN

393
00:31:08,075 --> 00:31:09,577
What are you trying to do here?

394
00:31:09,660 --> 00:31:12,371
I'm trying to win your trust
in high definition.

395
00:31:12,454 --> 00:31:13,789
Attorney Kim.

396
00:31:14,999 --> 00:31:17,668
Is every ten minutes not enough?
Then how about every five?

397
00:31:17,751 --> 00:31:20,504
If this could've fixed me,
I would have done it ages ago!

398
00:31:22,464 --> 00:31:25,259
You just admitted
there were other guys before me.

399
00:31:25,342 --> 00:31:26,510
And none of them worked?

400
00:31:27,052 --> 00:31:30,180
Then I'll be the first man
to cure your incurable condition.

401
00:31:32,933 --> 00:31:34,184
He must be mad.

402
00:31:35,894 --> 00:31:37,271
He's nuts.

403
00:31:40,608 --> 00:31:42,401
TAEKANG CULTURAL FOUNDATION

404
00:31:42,484 --> 00:31:45,362
CHAIRMAN NA MAN-SEOK

405
00:31:49,074 --> 00:31:49,992
Mi-jin.

406
00:31:51,660 --> 00:31:53,871
Word is spreading among the directors

407
00:31:53,954 --> 00:31:55,998
that Father is sending you
to the foundation.

408
00:31:56,874 --> 00:31:59,126
We won't need to wait
for the shareholder meeting.

409
00:31:59,209 --> 00:32:00,836
Only Yi-jun has it easy.

410
00:32:03,797 --> 00:32:05,132
A foundation post for you?

411
00:32:07,468 --> 00:32:10,137
Even I'm furious hearing about it.
How are you holding up?

412
00:32:16,018 --> 00:32:18,854
Then why don't you
have the foundation instead?

413
00:32:21,023 --> 00:32:21,940
Mi-jin.

414
00:32:25,611 --> 00:32:26,612
Na-jung.

415
00:32:27,488 --> 00:32:29,406
When you're at a crossroads,

416
00:32:29,948 --> 00:32:32,409
think about
where you'll be ten years from now.

417
00:32:33,077 --> 00:32:36,789
Will you regret your choice,

418
00:32:37,289 --> 00:32:39,541
or be proud of it?

419
00:32:41,126 --> 00:32:42,503
Remember this.

420
00:32:43,962 --> 00:32:45,047
That's how

421
00:32:46,382 --> 00:32:47,925
you make a decision.

422
00:32:51,220 --> 00:32:52,137
Okay.

423
00:32:57,559 --> 00:33:00,646
I think we'll find Park Min-hwan
by tomorrow.

424
00:33:01,105 --> 00:33:02,940
-Okay.
-Let's go.

425
00:33:06,026 --> 00:33:07,027
I'm leaving.

426
00:33:08,612 --> 00:33:09,488
Why are you here?

427
00:33:09,571 --> 00:33:11,490
Familiar places are more dangerous.

428
00:33:12,741 --> 00:33:14,493
Did you already forget the chandelier?

429
00:33:19,498 --> 00:33:22,126
Leave. I thought you had somewhere to go.

430
00:33:22,209 --> 00:33:24,002
Do you want to send me away?

431
00:33:24,086 --> 00:33:25,796
I think you keep forgetting this,

432
00:33:26,338 --> 00:33:27,923
but we're nothing now.

433
00:33:31,969 --> 00:33:33,262
So just leave.

434
00:33:57,286 --> 00:33:58,620
Even if I do this?

435
00:33:59,246 --> 00:34:00,706
Your heart is about to burst.

436
00:34:01,832 --> 00:34:03,083
Stop doing this.

437
00:34:03,167 --> 00:34:05,461
I'm grateful you saved our team

438
00:34:05,544 --> 00:34:07,379
and helped them keep their jobs.

439
00:34:07,463 --> 00:34:10,466
But I'm much more grateful
for this heart pounding in your chest.

440
00:34:11,884 --> 00:34:13,510
So stop telling me to leave.

441
00:34:13,594 --> 00:34:16,638
Am I supposed to always be Special Forces,
a detective, and fearless?

442
00:34:19,183 --> 00:34:21,518
Even when you push me away
as a joke, it hurts.

443
00:34:21,602 --> 00:34:25,022
But when you do it with that look
on your face, it really breaks my heart.

444
00:34:26,648 --> 00:34:28,817
Since you keep telling me to leave,
I'll go today.

445
00:34:30,110 --> 00:34:31,361
Check the security system.

446
00:34:42,956 --> 00:34:45,209
Even when you push me away
as a joke, it hurts.

447
00:34:45,292 --> 00:34:48,545
But when you do it with that look
on your face, it really breaks my heart.

448
00:34:59,348 --> 00:35:01,558
CAPTAIN PARK BONG-YI

449
00:35:12,194 --> 00:35:13,570
It's a match.

450
00:35:15,989 --> 00:35:16,907
It's the same person.

451
00:35:18,867 --> 00:35:20,619
We should consider the button's owner

452
00:35:20,702 --> 00:35:23,288
a suspect in Na Man-seok's death.

453
00:35:24,289 --> 00:35:26,124
We can't rule out the possibility

454
00:35:26,208 --> 00:35:28,877
that the person was involved
in Han Eun-young's death as well.

455
00:35:29,545 --> 00:35:31,713
Speaking of which,

456
00:35:32,923 --> 00:35:34,174
-is Yoon--
-Detective.

457
00:35:35,217 --> 00:35:36,385
Let's talk privately.

458
00:35:40,764 --> 00:35:41,974
I understand.

459
00:35:42,474 --> 00:35:44,017
I haven't told the team yet.

460
00:35:44,768 --> 00:35:47,187
We'll discuss how to further proceed.

461
00:35:50,983 --> 00:35:53,277
You feel guilty toward me?

462
00:35:53,902 --> 00:35:55,737
Do you have to take it this far?

463
00:36:10,919 --> 00:36:12,045
To me,

464
00:36:13,630 --> 00:36:15,173
you were like a mother.

465
00:36:16,675 --> 00:36:18,427
The only one I could rely on.

466
00:36:39,323 --> 00:36:41,241
I found something at that house that day.

467
00:36:49,958 --> 00:36:51,418
You recognize this, don't you?

468
00:36:54,588 --> 00:36:55,881
Where is Park Min-hwan?

469
00:36:58,508 --> 00:36:59,509
What do you mean?

470
00:37:02,012 --> 00:37:03,096
I want to believe you

471
00:37:03,180 --> 00:37:05,849
before the investigation
officially starts.

472
00:37:07,017 --> 00:37:09,436
I want to believe
you didn't steal the retained earnings

473
00:37:09,519 --> 00:37:11,021
and have someone killed.

474
00:37:14,733 --> 00:37:15,901
Please help me

475
00:37:17,819 --> 00:37:20,072
consider you as family.

476
00:37:25,243 --> 00:37:27,704
How are we family if it's going to crumble

477
00:37:29,456 --> 00:37:30,707
over something like this?

478
00:37:40,217 --> 00:37:41,885
I have a message for Manager Park.

479
00:37:44,137 --> 00:37:46,932
Tell him I need to meet him.

480
00:38:02,197 --> 00:38:04,074
If it's come to this, I have no choice.

481
00:38:06,076 --> 00:38:08,829
ON THE DAY OF NA MAN-SEOK'S DEATH

482
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:22,926
Mr. Yoon will be here soon.

483
00:38:24,720 --> 00:38:28,098
That's great. Uncle is on his way as well.

484
00:38:29,850 --> 00:38:31,727
Our clever Yi-jun

485
00:38:33,020 --> 00:38:34,438
found out

486
00:38:35,439 --> 00:38:37,232
where the money is.

487
00:38:41,153 --> 00:38:44,531
He's so naive that he believes in love
and wants to protect people.

488
00:38:44,614 --> 00:38:46,158
What could he possibly do?

489
00:38:51,038 --> 00:38:53,707
What are you planning to do to Mr. Yoon?

490
00:38:56,918 --> 00:38:57,919
Ma'am?

491
00:39:02,007 --> 00:39:03,091
CHIEF SECRETARY

492
00:39:03,175 --> 00:39:04,468
Ma'am.

493
00:39:08,597 --> 00:39:09,723
SPEAKER ON

494
00:39:09,806 --> 00:39:13,101
You have 40 minutes.
Take care of him before I arrive.

495
00:39:13,185 --> 00:39:14,603
Don't leave a trace.

496
00:39:15,854 --> 00:39:19,399
I prepared a place
where Manager Park can stay for a while.

497
00:39:35,582 --> 00:39:38,502
Yi-jun caught him red-handed
because of all the noise he made.

498
00:39:39,044 --> 00:39:40,253
He gave me no choice.

499
00:39:46,009 --> 00:39:49,387
The money was moved to a safe place
thanks to you.

500
00:39:51,556 --> 00:39:53,600
We have one more item to settle.

501
00:40:23,964 --> 00:40:26,675
You need to meet Yi-jun for me.

502
00:40:29,761 --> 00:40:33,223
He wants to see you, badly.

503
00:40:34,015 --> 00:40:35,725
He won't let me get away with this.

504
00:40:49,406 --> 00:40:51,533
Then don't give him the chance.

505
00:40:53,535 --> 00:40:54,995
We still have a deal to finish.

506
00:40:55,537 --> 00:40:56,496
Ma'am.

507
00:40:56,580 --> 00:40:59,791
Did you think the CFO position
would just fall into your lap?

508
00:41:02,210 --> 00:41:03,628
You have no sense of shame.

509
00:41:06,339 --> 00:41:08,925
Is it because
you've already sold it to me?

510
00:41:22,522 --> 00:41:24,232
Is that why you provoked her?

511
00:41:24,858 --> 00:41:26,526
If Mi-jin was involved in everything,

512
00:41:27,694 --> 00:41:29,029
she'll make a move.

513
00:41:30,363 --> 00:41:31,656
This is her last chance.

514
00:41:34,826 --> 00:41:35,660
Last chance?

515
00:41:36,536 --> 00:41:37,537
It's her last chance

516
00:41:39,080 --> 00:41:40,165
to remove me.

517
00:41:40,248 --> 00:41:41,583
And it's my chance

518
00:41:41,666 --> 00:41:43,501
to get my hands on the evidence

519
00:41:44,586 --> 00:41:45,629
Park Min-hwan took.

520
00:41:47,380 --> 00:41:48,465
Are you crazy?

521
00:41:49,299 --> 00:41:51,384
You saw what happened
to the chief secretary.

522
00:41:54,304 --> 00:41:56,264
I'LL HAND OVER THE TRANSACTION RECORDS

523
00:42:04,231 --> 00:42:05,482
Si-hyun.

524
00:42:08,985 --> 00:42:10,111
Let me ask you

525
00:42:12,155 --> 00:42:13,323
one last favor.

526
00:42:24,501 --> 00:42:25,543
Hye-jung.

527
00:42:26,211 --> 00:42:28,755
A guy who messages me
every ten minutes is bad enough.

528
00:42:29,547 --> 00:42:31,758
But a guy who shows up drunk
is even worse.

529
00:42:35,178 --> 00:42:36,721
You like this ice cream, right?

530
00:42:42,102 --> 00:42:43,103
Did you cry?

531
00:42:48,608 --> 00:42:49,484
No.

532
00:42:52,153 --> 00:42:53,154
I really didn't.

533
00:42:57,951 --> 00:42:59,619
The money is already gone.

534
00:42:59,703 --> 00:43:02,914
Ms. Yoon might've already used that money
to buy up friendly shares.

535
00:43:05,375 --> 00:43:08,586
There's no way to prove it
without meeting Min-hwan.

536
00:43:09,379 --> 00:43:13,008
So you have to convince him
to hand over the transaction records.

537
00:43:14,926 --> 00:43:16,177
What if he won't cooperate?

538
00:43:17,304 --> 00:43:19,014
Detective Kang is one thing,

539
00:43:19,556 --> 00:43:21,224
but there are other detectives too.

540
00:43:21,308 --> 00:43:23,393
They're suspended.
If something else happens,

541
00:43:23,476 --> 00:43:24,853
it can't be handled.

542
00:43:25,854 --> 00:43:29,107
Yi-jun knows that, so he's trying
to keep them out of harm's way.

543
00:43:29,190 --> 00:43:30,191
But still…

544
00:43:31,443 --> 00:43:33,320
Even if it's what Min-hwan demanded,

545
00:43:34,195 --> 00:43:35,488
he can't meet him alone.

546
00:43:37,198 --> 00:43:39,200
Mr. Yoon must be going through hell.

547
00:43:40,285 --> 00:43:42,829
He seemed to have relied on Ms. Yoon.

548
00:43:44,372 --> 00:43:45,957
That wretched family.

549
00:43:50,128 --> 00:43:52,047
He has no one he can trust.

550
00:43:58,928 --> 00:44:00,221
Is that why you cried?

551
00:44:01,514 --> 00:44:02,891
You felt bad for your friend?

552
00:44:09,314 --> 00:44:10,482
This is pathetic.

553
00:44:15,904 --> 00:44:17,322
Am I disappointing you again?

554
00:44:20,700 --> 00:44:21,701
No.

555
00:44:22,494 --> 00:44:23,495
Not at all.

556
00:44:57,529 --> 00:44:59,197
I wonder if he's sleeping well.

557
00:45:15,296 --> 00:45:16,673
What are you doing here?

558
00:45:16,756 --> 00:45:19,050
Milk is good for sleeping.

559
00:45:19,592 --> 00:45:22,595
I bought this one, so you can drink it.

560
00:45:23,304 --> 00:45:25,056
But there's something better.

561
00:45:33,106 --> 00:45:35,066
Where are we going?

562
00:45:35,150 --> 00:45:36,985
Just follow me.

563
00:45:42,157 --> 00:45:44,200
Taking a walk
is the best way to fall asleep.

564
00:45:46,578 --> 00:45:48,955
Don't concern yourself. We broke up.

565
00:45:49,831 --> 00:45:52,417
You're starting
to sound like a broken record.

566
00:45:52,500 --> 00:45:53,877
So listen to me.

567
00:45:55,336 --> 00:45:59,090
Stop looking at me
like you still have feelings for me.

568
00:46:02,260 --> 00:46:05,346
Wouldn't looking away
be neglecting my duties?

569
00:46:06,347 --> 00:46:07,640
You and your excuses.

570
00:46:10,894 --> 00:46:12,687
Take a look.

571
00:46:13,605 --> 00:46:16,733
When you look at the night view
from a place like this,

572
00:46:17,567 --> 00:46:19,611
everything looks so small.

573
00:46:20,195 --> 00:46:23,907
Everything we've been worried about
means nothing.

574
00:46:25,325 --> 00:46:27,410
If you go home after realizing--

575
00:46:41,132 --> 00:46:42,884
What if we just keep things like this?

576
00:46:44,052 --> 00:46:44,969
No.

577
00:46:45,887 --> 00:46:47,639
Then keep pushing me away, Yi-jun.

578
00:46:48,306 --> 00:46:50,475
I'll cling to you
using protection as an excuse.

579
00:46:51,559 --> 00:46:52,644
Stop.

580
00:46:53,645 --> 00:46:56,981
You acting like this
isn't helping me at all.

581
00:47:01,903 --> 00:47:03,947
But you've always been watching me.

582
00:47:05,365 --> 00:47:06,908
I was selfish

583
00:47:09,160 --> 00:47:10,495
for breaking up with you.

584
00:47:11,663 --> 00:47:13,498
I thought it was the only way

585
00:47:15,041 --> 00:47:17,502
to protect you and save your team.

586
00:47:20,463 --> 00:47:22,257
Is this an apology

587
00:47:24,175 --> 00:47:25,051
or foreshadowing?

588
00:47:31,432 --> 00:47:32,600
I'm the one

589
00:47:33,643 --> 00:47:35,603
who has to solve this case.

590
00:47:36,896 --> 00:47:38,064
I know.

591
00:47:38,648 --> 00:47:40,984
So wrap it up and come back to me.

592
00:47:41,693 --> 00:47:43,027
I'll wait for you.

593
00:48:21,649 --> 00:48:24,736
Did you not receive a call
from forensics for the button?

594
00:48:26,404 --> 00:48:27,739
No, not yet. Why?

595
00:48:27,822 --> 00:48:29,073
We'll talk later.

596
00:48:30,825 --> 00:48:32,493
MANAGER PARK MIN-HWAN

597
00:48:36,914 --> 00:48:39,334
Good job, everyone.
We'll wrap things up tomorrow.

598
00:48:39,417 --> 00:48:41,002
-Sure.
-Okay.

599
00:48:43,212 --> 00:48:44,422
Heading back to the office?

600
00:48:44,505 --> 00:48:47,091
Yes. You said you needed
the foundation's financial report.

601
00:48:47,175 --> 00:48:48,509
It's in my drawer.

602
00:48:49,510 --> 00:48:51,012
I won't have time to come back.

603
00:48:51,095 --> 00:48:52,430
Does anyone want to help me?

604
00:48:54,891 --> 00:48:56,809
Could you help me, Detective Kang?

605
00:48:56,893 --> 00:48:58,853
You're familiar with the office building.

606
00:49:01,147 --> 00:49:02,315
Is it urgent?

607
00:49:03,441 --> 00:49:04,984
-Thanks.
-No problem.

608
00:49:05,443 --> 00:49:06,986
-Thank you, Detective Kang.
-Sure.

609
00:49:13,409 --> 00:49:14,285
Wait.

610
00:49:16,120 --> 00:49:17,038
What?

611
00:49:20,166 --> 00:49:21,751
Take this for your cold.

612
00:49:26,214 --> 00:49:27,048
Thank you.

613
00:49:51,614 --> 00:49:53,157
You still haven't found it?

614
00:49:53,616 --> 00:49:56,077
Yi-jun always does well
organizing his desk.

615
00:49:56,160 --> 00:49:58,204
You can't ever find anything.

616
00:49:59,414 --> 00:50:01,332
Does Mr. Yoon have plans today?

617
00:50:01,416 --> 00:50:02,959
What plans?

618
00:50:03,042 --> 00:50:04,585
Or is he meeting someone?

619
00:50:04,669 --> 00:50:05,670
Who? Who would he meet?

620
00:50:07,463 --> 00:50:09,048
Did he tell you to keep me here?

621
00:50:09,132 --> 00:50:10,925
Why would he want to keep you…

622
00:50:18,266 --> 00:50:19,559
I can't believe this.

623
00:50:23,688 --> 00:50:25,648
Hold on. It's nothing.

624
00:50:25,982 --> 00:50:27,817
He'll just meet him and get the documents.

625
00:50:27,900 --> 00:50:30,945
Why are you doing this when it's nothing?
That doesn't make sense.

626
00:50:31,028 --> 00:50:33,531
You rush in whenever
it's something to do with him.

627
00:50:33,614 --> 00:50:35,324
Please understand him.

628
00:50:36,200 --> 00:50:37,285
I knew it.

629
00:50:37,702 --> 00:50:40,037
He made me let my guard down, so he could…

630
00:50:40,621 --> 00:50:41,664
Move.

631
00:50:42,457 --> 00:50:46,127
You're his friend, not mine.
You should be worried about him.

632
00:50:46,669 --> 00:50:48,629
Right. I'm his friend.

633
00:50:49,172 --> 00:50:51,132
I want you to stay with him.

634
00:50:51,215 --> 00:50:52,717
I want you to get stabbed for him.

635
00:50:52,800 --> 00:50:53,843
Then, move.

636
00:50:53,926 --> 00:50:55,052
But Yi-jun says

637
00:50:56,554 --> 00:50:59,098
he can't watch you get hurt again.

638
00:50:59,974 --> 00:51:01,309
This is the last time

639
00:51:02,101 --> 00:51:03,561
I'm asking nicely.

640
00:51:08,816 --> 00:51:10,651
I'm a lawyer and a rational person.

641
00:51:11,360 --> 00:51:13,613
But you're the first person
he wanted to protect

642
00:51:14,155 --> 00:51:15,907
since his mother.

643
00:51:17,992 --> 00:51:19,410
I have to try my best.

644
00:51:30,338 --> 00:51:31,506
What brings you here?

645
00:51:32,381 --> 00:51:33,591
Close the door.

646
00:51:33,674 --> 00:51:34,509
No.

647
00:51:34,967 --> 00:51:36,260
No!

648
00:51:42,600 --> 00:51:44,685
It's faster than a car. Hold on tight.

649
00:51:45,144 --> 00:51:46,854
Thank you. I'll repay you.

650
00:52:19,554 --> 00:52:20,847
Do you want to have a seat?

651
00:52:21,347 --> 00:52:22,181
Sir.

652
00:52:24,892 --> 00:52:27,061
I lied about handing over

653
00:52:28,563 --> 00:52:29,897
the transaction records.

654
00:52:40,783 --> 00:52:41,784
I'm sorry.

655
00:52:49,083 --> 00:52:51,085
Let's continue this
after you put that down.

656
00:52:52,628 --> 00:52:55,590
I sent the police and Attorney Kim away

657
00:52:55,673 --> 00:52:57,216
just as I promised.

658
00:52:58,634 --> 00:53:01,304
No. If I don't shoot you now,

659
00:53:01,762 --> 00:53:02,930
I'll die.

660
00:53:05,474 --> 00:53:07,018
I wanted to apologize

661
00:53:09,186 --> 00:53:10,688
for bringing you into this mess.

662
00:53:13,441 --> 00:53:14,609
It's all my fault.

663
00:53:18,988 --> 00:53:21,574
No, it's not.

664
00:53:21,657 --> 00:53:22,992
I betrayed you.

665
00:53:24,452 --> 00:53:26,037
And I'm trying to--

666
00:53:26,120 --> 00:53:28,289
Everyone makes mistakes.

667
00:53:28,998 --> 00:53:30,583
What comes after is what matters.

668
00:53:31,918 --> 00:53:33,961
This is your chance to set things right.

669
00:53:35,046 --> 00:53:36,213
Manager Park.

670
00:53:50,686 --> 00:53:51,687
What's wrong with me?

671
00:53:53,564 --> 00:53:54,899
Can we turn things back?

672
00:53:54,982 --> 00:53:55,983
After you…

673
00:54:02,865 --> 00:54:04,617
take responsibility for what you did,

674
00:54:07,161 --> 00:54:08,371
I'll reinstate you.

675
00:54:21,884 --> 00:54:22,885
Yi-jun!

676
00:54:51,956 --> 00:54:53,332
Manager Park!

677
00:55:15,146 --> 00:55:16,355
Kang Jae-hee!

678
00:55:17,356 --> 00:55:18,315
Sergeant Go!

679
00:55:19,734 --> 00:55:20,818
No.

680
00:55:21,360 --> 00:55:22,194
No!

681
00:55:30,661 --> 00:55:32,329
-Jae-hee!
-You need to hide!

682
00:55:43,007 --> 00:55:44,008
Jae-hee!

683
00:55:44,717 --> 00:55:45,843
You were so reckless!

684
00:55:46,969 --> 00:55:47,970
Watch out!

685
00:55:52,516 --> 00:55:53,476
Mr. Yoon.

686
00:55:54,435 --> 00:55:55,394
On three,

687
00:55:56,645 --> 00:55:58,105
we run.

688
00:55:58,522 --> 00:55:59,482
Jae-hee.

689
00:56:00,566 --> 00:56:01,442
One.

690
00:56:03,319 --> 00:56:04,195
Three.

691
00:56:14,830 --> 00:56:15,706
No!

692
00:56:51,575 --> 00:56:52,535
Jae-hee.

693
00:56:54,078 --> 00:56:55,621
You didn't hesitate this time.

694
00:56:57,915 --> 00:56:59,375
You saved me.

695
00:57:01,836 --> 00:57:03,921
So be free of your guilt.

696
00:57:18,352 --> 00:57:19,436
I had a dream.

697
00:57:22,982 --> 00:57:24,233
In my dream,

698
00:57:25,109 --> 00:57:26,610
we were an ordinary couple.

699
00:57:47,715 --> 00:57:50,259
We sincerely cared for

700
00:57:50,843 --> 00:57:52,386
and loved each other.

701
00:57:56,432 --> 00:57:59,351
We were happy and joyful.

702
00:58:02,354 --> 00:58:06,025
On a warm, breezy day,

703
00:58:08,068 --> 00:58:09,695
I proposed to you.

704
00:58:12,531 --> 00:58:13,908
And you said yes.

705
00:58:17,786 --> 00:58:18,746
Jae-hee.

706
00:58:21,165 --> 00:58:24,251
How about we meet like that
in our next lives?

707
00:58:27,713 --> 00:58:29,006
-Check his vitals.
-Yes.

708
00:58:29,089 --> 00:58:30,966
Sir, can you hear me?

709
00:58:32,092 --> 00:58:33,928
Step aside. Checking his vital signs.

710
00:58:34,678 --> 00:58:36,222
Prepare for a blood transfusion.

711
00:58:36,305 --> 00:58:38,849
No, not our next lives.

712
00:58:40,559 --> 00:58:43,520
I told you it's my first time
loving someone like this

713
00:58:45,064 --> 00:58:48,400
and that I don't know how to break up.

714
00:58:50,277 --> 00:58:51,278
So,

715
00:58:52,446 --> 00:58:53,989
I won't let you go.

716
00:58:55,324 --> 00:58:56,700
I'll keep waiting for you.

717
00:58:58,535 --> 00:58:59,954
I'll wait for you every day.

718
00:59:01,622 --> 00:59:03,207
So just come to me.

719
00:59:05,292 --> 00:59:07,962
I love you, Yi-jun.

720
00:59:09,713 --> 00:59:10,714
I love you.

721
01:00:01,849 --> 01:00:03,726
SPECIAL THANKS TO KIM DO-YOON,
PARK JUN-MUYN, AND JUNG YOO-MIN

722
01:00:07,813 --> 01:00:10,065
-Where's Jae-hee?
-Jae-hee!

723
01:00:10,149 --> 01:00:11,233
Call a board meeting.

724
01:00:11,317 --> 01:00:12,443
Contain the chaos first.

725
01:00:13,152 --> 01:00:15,112
Are you going to change the CEO candidate?

726
01:00:15,738 --> 01:00:17,740
I heard they're not going to
last much longer.

727
01:00:17,823 --> 01:00:20,951
I won't fall apart
and I'll live responsibly

728
01:00:21,035 --> 01:00:22,369
for the people I care about.

729
01:00:22,453 --> 01:00:26,040
At times, it feels like
you came to me to save me.

730
01:00:26,123 --> 01:00:29,168
At times?
I'm the one who's always saving you.

731
01:00:29,251 --> 01:00:31,920
And I'll keep saving you.

732
01:00:32,004 --> 01:00:33,714
Thank you, Jae-hee.

733
01:00:33,797 --> 01:00:35,674
Jae-hee.

734
01:00:39,553 --> 01:00:42,556
Translated by Leo Chung
